Do not generate generic landing pages.

Design target:
- Awwwards
- Godly
- SiteInspire
- Land-book

Rules:
- every page must have one dominant visual focal point
- avoid equal-width repetitive card grids unless truly needed
- use large type and confident spacing
- create memorable transitions between sections
- make the layout feel cinematic and expensive
- prefer custom composition over default sections
- use motion to support storytelling, not to decorate

The result must feel like a premium creative agency website worth a high-budget client.